/-!
# Formalization of the current direct Fourier construction

The import graph is separate from the frozen V7 `AFT` entry point.
`ActualConstructiveSampler.constructive_gaussian_aft` assembles the actual
finite-bit sampler, polynomial bit and work bounds, all-branch modular
invertibility, and arbitrary fixed inverse-polynomial Gaussian transport
accuracy. `ActualConstructiveSampler.quantitative_eventually` gives the
Fourier, clipping/source, and numerical error decomposition of
`thm:df-constructive-aft`. Runtime is measured in the explicit Boolean-list
and counter model documented in NUMERICAL_IMPLEMENTATION.md, including the
actual flat-tape decoder. `ActualAffineEvaluator` supplies deterministic
affine evaluation with polynomial work in the input encoding length.
The current verification results and interfaces are recorded in CURRENT_STATUS.md.
-/
